  "question_stem": "Throughout this question the use of a calculator is not permitted.\n\nThe complex numbers $u$ and $w$ are defined by $u = -1 + 7i$ and $w = 3 + 4i$.",
  "context_texts": [
    "$$u - 2w = -7 - \\mathrm{i} \\quad \\text{and} \\quad \\dfrac{u}{w} = 1 + \\mathrm{i}$$",
    "$$\\arg(u/w) = \\arg(1 + \\mathrm{i}) = \\dfrac{1}{4}\\pi, \\quad \\text{so } \\angle AOB = \\dfrac{1}{4}\\pi$$"
  ],
